nvgpu: update thermal GPIO and clock-provider APIs

Use a managed GPIO descriptor for the thermal interrupt and release
the device-tree reference on both success and failure. Adapt the old
clock rounding helper to determine_rate, preserving negative errors
and its selected parent rate.

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/nvgpu/os/linux/module.c b/drivers/gpu/nvgpu/os/linux/module.c
